  lines:
  - speakerName: Ghost
    text: You've already seen the world you've been missing.
    side: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Ghost
    text: Now let's take a closer look at what you've been leaving behind.
    side: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Arthur
    text: And what is that?
    side: 1
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Ghost
    text: Something you cared about.
    side: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Ghost
    text: You used to paint. Not for anyone else, not only to post it online. You did it for yourself.
    side: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Ghost
    text: Just look at the unfinished painting in your room.
    side: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
